## Article 5. Requirements for Appeal

```catala
declaration scope Article5AppealRequirements:
  input author content AppealAuthor
  input appealForm content AppealForm
  input addressee content AddresseeType
  input containsSubstance content YesNo
  input requiredInfoComplete content YesNo
  input hasComplaintRedressAgency content YesNo
  output meetsNameRequirement content YesNo
  output meetsResidenceRequirement content YesNo
  output meetsSubstanceRequirement content YesNo
  output meetsSignatureRequirement content YesNo
  output meetsEmailRequirement content YesNo
  output meetsAllRequirements content YesNo
  output returnValueDeadline content integer
  output canBeReturned content YesNo

scope Article5AppealRequirements:
  label default_name
  definition meetsNameRequirement equals No

  label name_provided_exception
  exception default_name
  definition meetsNameRequirement under condition
    author.lastName != 0 and author.firstName != 0
    consequence equals Yes

  label default_residence
  definition meetsResidenceRequirement equals No

  label residence_provided_exception
  exception default_residence
  definition meetsResidenceRequirement under condition
    author.residence != 0
    consequence equals Yes

  label default_substance
  definition meetsSubstanceRequirement equals No

  label substance_provided_exception
  exception default_substance
  definition meetsSubstanceRequirement under condition
    containsSubstance = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label default_signature
  definition meetsSignatureRequirement equals No

  label signed_exception
  exception default_signature
  definition meetsSignatureRequirement under condition
    appealForm = Written and not (author.category = HeroOfUSSR)
    consequence equals Yes

  label default_email
  definition meetsEmailRequirement equals No

  label email_provided_exception
  exception default_email
  definition meetsEmailRequirement under condition
    appealForm = Electronic and author.emailAddress != 0
    consequence equals Yes

  definition meetsAllRequirements equals Yes
  
  exception
  definition meetsAllRequirements under condition
    meetsNameRequirement = No or
    meetsResidenceRequirement = No or
    meetsSubstanceRequirement = No or
    meetsSignatureRequirement = No or
    meetsEmailRequirement = No
    consequence equals No

  label default_return
  definition returnValueDeadline equals 0

  label return_deadline_exception
  exception default_return
  definition returnValueDeadline under condition
    meetsAllRequirements = No
    consequence equals 10

  label default_cannot_return
  definition canBeReturned equals No

  label can_be_returned_exception
  exception default_cannot_return
  definition canBeReturned under condition
    meetsAllRequirements = No
    consequence equals Yes
```
